        137.97039794921875
      ],
      "text_sha256": "34c4c030bc5261af7549d7f6c79a998bdf3c1a7995b4456f89381559462a4595"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0913-block-0025",
      "order": 25,
      "text": "Some ‘specials’ liquids can \nbe made for NG delivery.\n",
      "bbox": [
        339.6864929199219,
        142.0954132080078,
        425.9515686035156,
        160.8004150390625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "42f8310deea7f41f154595178e345ddc20b1b42c738276f15d903e0208c85c20"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0913-block-0026",
      "order": 26,
      "text": "Before crushing tablets and \nmixing with water, confirm \nstability with either local \nguidelines or the drug \nmanufacturer.\n",
      "bbox": [
        339.6864929199219,
        164.92543029785156,
        429.1540832519531,
        213.6229248046875
      ],
      "text_sha256": "fb21b82fab559d892d0717b913c8a465a8921317587bc42441ca054b6d343e74"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0913-block-0027",
      "order": 27,
      "text": "Benzodiazepines4,9\n■\n■Reduced requirements for induction \n",
      "bbox": [
        61.89398193359375,
        334.2679138183594,
        268.48590087890625,
        343.0003967285156
      ],
      "text_sha256": "a8e2d92f5f651ab31a162e479b230a6f3263d395dce027cc5a399419c8988bbc"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0913-block-0028",
      "order": 28,
      "text": "and maintenance anaesthetics\n",
      "bbox": [
        151.65089416503906,
        344.2904052734375,
        248.32586669921875,
        352.9978942871094
      ],
      "text_sha256": "7e92db5e3f32738836dd40151dabefac650cc770619520209744246cd1fdee77"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0913-block-0029",
      "order": 29,
      "text": "■\n■Many have prolonged action (days \n",
      "bbox": [
        144.0959014892578,
        354.29290771484375,
        263.6258850097656,
        363.0003967285156
      ],
      "text_sha256": "100361df530a657e69a302dba2bac5b467f88b8532bf667ad59fe53e9a77ab7c"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0913-block-0030",
      "order": 30,
      "text": "or weeks), so early withdrawal is \nnecessary\n",
      "bbox": [
        151.65089416503906,
        364.2904052734375,
        257.4984130859375,
        382.9953918457031
      ],
      "text_sha256": "34d99c20dfb895cec5cb353954a926d449dfc8b3fded4d9db919d0a94428be31"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0913-block-0031",
      "order": 31,
      "text": "■\n■Withdrawal symptoms possible\n",
      "bbox": [
        144.0959014892578,
        384.29290771484375,
        251.0033416748047,
        393.0003967285156
      ],
      "text_sha256": "06aecbb0a338d6a39b8ef28b20a14229bb5489620a1f23429591d75eee67db0a"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0913-block-0032",
      "order": 32,
      "text": "Probably; usually \ncontinued\n",
      "bbox": [
        274.48590087890625,
        334.2904052734375,
        329.77593994140625,
        352.9953918457031
      ],
      "text_sha256": "dad53985d0ef47347f36e7e55eb69638f71c2100481a5ed5d069d87404b20236"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0913-block-0033",
      "order": 33,
      "text": "Liquid, IM, IV and rectal \ndiazepam are available (do \nnot use IM route).\n",
      "bbox": [
        339.68341064453125,
        334.2904052734375,
        426.638427734375,
        362.9928894042969
      ],
      "text_sha256": "cc6c9d519a8fef82f0599c666dba8d958bcf413a2a2d2d239672bcd314dee7e0"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0913-block-0034",
      "order": 34,
      "text": "Buccal liquid available for \nmidazolam\n",
      "bbox": [
        339.68341064453125,
        367.1178894042969,
        422.6034851074219,
        385.8228759765625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "16ede509d3287a884513923ed69fda48905f7886833b701b762d492bf54cb697"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0913-block-0035",
      "order": 35,
      "text": "Sublingual (use normal \ntablets), IM, IV and \nlorazepam are available.\n",
      "bbox": [
        339.68341064453125,
        389.9478759765625,
        416.62591552734375,
        418.6503601074219
      ],
      "text_sha256": "f799fbbc98af807ea147606069269ecb818e5236f9d25337fd7ef63132ea6ce3"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0913-block-0036",
      "order": 36,
      "text": "Lithium3,4,12,15\n■\n■Prolongs the action of both \n",
      "bbox": [
        61.890899658203125,
        424.9653625488281,
        241.12588500976562,
        433.6947021484375
      ],
      "text_sha256": "8df44ba9b5dd41f67831503a98215ae695b527666a0af08c1d22a2da2eb843e1"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0913-block-0037",
      "order": 37,
      "text": "depolarising and non-depolarising \nmuscle relaxants\n",
      "bbox": [
        151.65089416503906,
        434.9847106933594,
        262.5233459472656,
        453.689697265625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "753ac3d041dd34e8cb28d3bb75f86a4775d55abf18d4aac9ff81828c23ada5f9"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0913-block-0038",
      "order": 38,
      "text": "■\n■Surgery-related electrolyte \n",
      "bbox": [
        144.0959014892578,
        454.9872131347656,
        237.1958770751953,
        463.6947021484375
      ],
      "text_sha256": "d9ca4dda06174dea4d902c308c9774ac4f1d3c2117572f2c5e1c156f0bf15297"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0913-block-0039",
      "order": 39,
      "text": "disturbance and reduced renal \nfunction may precipitate lithium \ntoxicity. Avoid dehydration and \nNSAIDs\n",
      "bbox": [
        151.65089416503906,
        464.9847106933594,
        255.6758575439453,
        503.6846923828125
      ],
      "text_sha256": "8b3fcf45965c4af26878bdbbf1529f070172506e7570b4e93c4abe8aebabb101"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0913-block-0040",
      "order": 40,
      "text": "■\n■Possible increased risk of arrhythmia\n",
      "bbox": [
        144.0959014892578,
        504.9872131347656,
        266.9333801269531,
        513.6947021484375
      ],
      "text_sha256": "d8f96f2716250635e34f75d556b816f96a17a549a0814e50e856d30214173c6e"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0913-block-0041",
      "order": 41,
      "text": "Probably safe in \nminor surgery but \nusually \ndiscontinued \nbefore major \nprocedures and \nre-started once \nelectrolytes \nnormalise\n",
      "bbox": [
        274.48590087890625,
        424.9847106933594,
        333.66094970703125,
        513.6721801757812
      ],
      "text_sha256": "d170a5d66601990a10e44ce867426ada0016f6124396ddead65c696ddeb920ae"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0913-block-0042",
      "order": 42,
      "text": "Slow \ndiscontinuation is \nessential \n– anaesthetists \nmay not \nappreciate this34\n",
      "bbox": [
        274.48590087890625,
        517.7971801757812,
        332.416015625,
        576.4921875
      ],
      "text_sha256": "c782a3d6eade1fd1a9b28e669f6b355fcea91dbe75768f4a0d0e28890d65a646"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0913-block-0043",
      "order": 43,
      "text": "The bioavailability of \nlithium varies between \nbrands. Care is needed \nwith equivalent doses of \nsalts: lithium carbonate \n200mg = lithium citrate \n509mg.\n",
